    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44672" root="&#xA;                        وفى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَفَى بِالعَهْدِ</span></b>  and 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالوَعْدِ</span></b> 
                         [<i>He fulfilled, performed, kept,</i> or <i>was faithful to, the compact,</i>
or <i>covenant,</i> and <i>the promise</i>]: act. part. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَفِىٌّ</span>;
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْفِيَآءُ</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَفَآءٌ</span> signifies The <i>being
faithful to an engagement,</i> or <i>promise:</i> see 1,
last sentence, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رعى</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَفَاهُ</span>
                        <i>He paid it:</i>
see an ex. (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى ثَوْبَىْ أَبِى أَنْ أَفِيَهُ</span>) voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَوْبٌ</span>.

